  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Feedback Management and Quality Measurement in DREF Operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project strengthens the operational quality, accountability and responsiveness of DREF operations by establishing an emergency-ready Community Feedback Management system combined with automated Qualitative Feedback Analysis support. The project will provide a pre-configured feedback management system that can be rapidly deployed in DREF operations, either through a centrally hosted shared instance or through a National Society&#x2013;hosted instance; alongside technical assistance, capacity strengthening and global-level quality monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
